+/* RSX_VB_PACK: bind the VP vertex buffer for records stored with attribute
+ * set `mask`: input slot i (ATTRi) reads column pos(i) of a vertex of stride
+ * 16 x |mask|, starting at this parity half. Slots the program does not read
